OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear
OL,6,Fintervals and a few light showers this
OL,7,Fevening. Orkney then turning clear and
OL,8,Fdry overnight, while Shetland will be
OL,9,Fcloudier with still the chance of the
OL,10,Fodd light shower.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FOrkney will have a dry day
OL,13,Fwith long sunny spells. Shetland may
OL,14,Fcatch a light shower at first, then
OL,15,Fcloud breaking to allow sunny spells.
OL,16,FSouthwesterly winds will gradually
OL,17,Ffreshen.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
